# v2.0 generated asset copies.
# Produced by `dart run tool/build_v2_assets.dart` from the repository-root
# 素材/ package (the single official resource index). Not committed to avoid
# duplicating ~20 MiB of binaries that already live in 素材/.
# 只有 manifest.json 是构建复制品；同一目录下的 player.json /
# enemies.json 等是**手写内容配置**，必须入库。
/assets/config/v2/manifest.json
/assets/images/v2/
/assets/audio/v2/
test/golden/failures/
build/reports/
